summary:
  The sleeve of the artist's other record from iTunes is asked for 300 pixels wide.

history:
  The artist's own songs on iTunes are a second place the same address
  is built, for the sleeve that stands in when no catalogue has the song.
  It is shown on the same cover, at the same size. This mutant leaves that
  one at 300.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
      return pick >= 0 ? { "url": cands[pick].art.replace("100x100bb", "600x600bb"), "kind": "release" } : null;

replace:
      return pick >= 0 ? { "url": cands[pick].art.replace("100x100bb", "300x300bb"), "kind": "release" } : null;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_artkind.qml::test_the_artists_itunes_songs_are_another_release.
  Line-neutral.
